WEBVTT

00:38:58.371 --> 00:39:03.746
That if we got somebody who is extremely
concerned about about gun safety,

00:39:04.121 --> 00:39:06.788
to imagine having been born
in a hunting family,

00:39:07.204 --> 00:39:10.829
they actually were less nasty than to
somebody on the other side of the aisle.

00:39:10.829 --> 00:39:12.746
So I think there might
be something to this.

00:39:14.704 --> 00:39:18.496
Fantastic. So I can't thank you enough for
talking to me on your show about you,

00:39:19.246 --> 00:39:22.329
you should do the the goodbye
because it's your show.

00:39:22.329 --> 00:39:25.038
But I just I wanted to thank you for
the the honor and opportunity.

00:39:25.371 --> 00:39:27.413
Well, I can't thank you enough for coming.

00:39:27.413 --> 00:39:29.621
I'm so grateful that you read the book.